// Applying the unit with a unit.
// It is stuck with C-Err.
()( () )

// Same, but as an argument to the identity, which is also stuck.
(x => x)( ()( () ))

// Thunk for applying the unit with a unit.
// Because the inner stuck term is not actually evaluated,
// this term is not really stuck, and we can infer a weak-type.
thunk => ()( () )

